  "description": "HL7 specifies a standardization that allows computer systems in healthcare organizations to communicate with each other.\r\n\r\nThe HL7 vocabulary consists of hierarchical Concept Domains, which are categories of like concepts that will be bound to one or more coded elements; code systems, which are the contexts in which concepts are defined; and value sets, which are lists of intended values for a Concept Domain or sub-domain.",
